  "tone": {
    "$description": "Semantic surface tones. Each names a background, the text colour that goes on it, an accent, and a hover background. build-tokens.mjs derives the rest (muted text, border, field fill, focus ring) and scripts/contrast.mjs fails the build if any pair is below WCAG AA. Apply with data-tone=\"…\"; components read only --tone-* and never a primitive.",
